Description: A faster, refactored derivative of the 'WorldFlora' package (Kindt 2020,
    <doi:10.1002/aps3.11388>). Matches lists of plant names, exactly or with fuzzy
    matching, against a static copy of the World Flora Online taxonomic backbone, which
    it downloads from Zenodo, and returns the accepted names. Works with the WFO Plant
    List 2026-06 and earlier releases. By default, functions, arguments and results are
    those of 'WorldFlora', with its errors corrected; optional matching steps handle
    truncated genera, species transferred to another genus, short epithets and local
    names.
